WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.021 --> 00:00:08.232
A rule is a fixed check with an id, a field, a dimension and a severity.

2
00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:15.645
The facts line: failing records across objects, the share, value at risk, over tolerance, features blocked.

3
00:00:15.645 --> 00:00:21.899
Definition: the check class, the field, the expression and the SAP authority.

4
00:00:21.899 --> 00:00:26.814
Versions: who changed the rule, when and why.

5
00:00:26.814 --> 00:00:31.820
Scope: every object and system the rule runs on, with its failing count.

6
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:39.675
The rule inspector holds the same facts beside any canvas.

7
00:00:39.675 --> 00:00:46.890
Tolerance: only critical rules carry one. Over it, the rule caps the score.

8
00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:51.933
Comment on the rule, and watch it.

9
00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:59.290
The rules library lists every rule of the tenant.

10
00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:06.396
Filter by object, dimension, severity, check class and state.

11
00:01:06.396 --> 00:01:13.997
Drafts run nowhere until they are reviewed and enabled.

12
00:01:13.997 --> 00:01:20.557
New rule draft starts a rule in authoring.
